title=\"2026-09-12 18:24:47 +08:00\">21h 46m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>确实是这个问题，而且打乱预期。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18078366\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b38c/efb6/36502_normal.png?m=1698393818\" alt=\"RexKang\" data-uid=\"36502\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/RexKang\">RexKang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-12 18:44:16 +08:00\">21h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Plus 终于熬到了重置，不过浪费了 18%。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18078388\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5cbf/296d/186159_normal.png?m=1702003730\" alt=\"lifei6671\" data-uid=\"186159\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lifei6671\">lifei6671</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-12 18:56:55 +08:00\">21h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我昨天刚用了重置卡，今天才刚用到 5%，就重置了，还不如给重置卡。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18078398\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4dfa/8c1c/38436_normal.png?m=1789163514\" alt=\"msg7086\" data-uid=\"38436\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/msg7086\">msg7086</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-12 19:00:14 +08:00\">21h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>如果你使用速度是完全平均匀速的，重置就不亏不赚。如果你蹬得比匀速快，重置就几乎总是赚的。<br>本来到 15 号你能用掉 2 个周限，现在变成到 19 号能用掉 3 个半周限。结果来看就是赚的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18078739\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/81865d92cb26408e850ce0289a7a5e30?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Kokomashiro\" data-uid=\"392987\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Kokomashiro\">Kokomashiro</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-12 22:27:21 +08:00\">17h 43m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>所以现在我的策略就完全变了，额度重置就 astra 猛猛蹬，基本上两天可以用到只剩 20%，剩下的就转网页版+luna ，然后等重置。哪怕就是真的没有重置，20x 的 20%luna 也完全够蹬到自然重置。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18078940\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7ec314ce8f6b598f0ac398ea061a176f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"lrigi\" data-uid=\"158602\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lrigi\">lrigi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-13 01:34:56 +08:00\">14h 36m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>没事的 过几天可能又重置 大胆用就完了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18078957\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c517/de47/372088_normal.png?m=1784135778\" alt=\"yu6564172\" data-uid=\"372088\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yu6564172\">yu6564172</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-13 02:23:48 +08:00\">13h 47m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>如果是真实用量额度, 不削弱, 不降智, 那重置没问题, 但是实际上就是现在用重置的更多, 用量反而不如之前耐用, 200 刀的大概就是以前 70 刀的用量</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18079014\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2aadd08fc12d1da753775aa0e381289b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yjiefl\" data-uid=\"559015\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yjiefl\">yjiefl</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-13 07:11:20 +08:00\">8h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>现在不管他是否重置我都按节奏用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18079252\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/291a/bcf6/541752_normal.png?m=1786340079\" alt=\"lightyisu\" data-uid=\"541752\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lightyisu\">lightyisu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-13 11:03:01 +08:00\">5h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>一般来说猜测每次充值都是自然充值的前俩天就好了 人 oai 也不傻</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","